      "content": "I'll read the original test file and the CUT to understand what needs to be improved.Now I'll write the improved test file using parameterized tests to eliminate the repetitive `assertEquals` calls and make each test case self-documenting.Now I'll compile-check it.The improved test compiled successfully. The refactored test replaces 16 repetitive `assertEquals` calls with a single `@ParameterizedTest` + `@CsvSource`, making each test case (expected code, input name) self-documenting and the overall structure much easier to scan and maintain."
